<title>UK: LIFFE Dec certified coffee stocks down at 1,875.</title>
<headline>LIFFE Dec certified coffee stocks down at 1,875.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>LIFFE certified coffee stocks fell 229 five-tonne lots to 1,875 lots in December from 2,104 in November, the exchange said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Traders said the drop was in line with earlier expectations. -- London newsroom +44 171 542 4985</p>
